     rw_cells asegs m2 spa [CB 8 j8; C8 (Z_to_bv 64 ff); CB 80 j80] ->
     rw_cells asegs m2 (spa + 96) gap -> Z.of_nat (cells_size gap) = bv_unsigned sp + -96 - (spa + 96) ->
